## Chapter 6 — System Design & Architecture

### 6.1 High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client["Frontend — Next.js 15 (Vercel)"]
        UI[React Components]
        AR[App Router — Pages]
        API_SVC[API Service Layer — Axios]
        AUTH_CTX[Auth Context — useAuth]
    end

    subgraph Server["Backend — Express 4.x (Railway)"]
        MW[Middleware Stack]
        CTRL[Controllers — 11 modules]
        SVC[Services — Notification + Storage]
        ROUTES[Routes — 10 modules]
    end

    subgraph DB["Supabase Cloud"]
        PG[(PostgreSQL 15 + PostGIS)]
        AUTH_SB[Supabase Auth — JWT]
        STORE[Supabase Storage — 4 buckets]
    end

    subgraph AI["AI Pipeline"]
        N8N[n8n Webhook]
        PLANTNET[PlantNet API]
        GEMINI[Google Gemini]
    end

    UI --> AR --> API_SVC
    API_SVC -->|"REST API calls\n(Bearer JWT)"| ROUTES
    AUTH_CTX -->|"Token mgmt"| API_SVC
    ROUTES --> MW --> CTRL --> SVC
    CTRL --> PG
    CTRL --> AUTH_SB
    SVC --> STORE
    CTRL -->|"POST /ai/identify"| N8N
    N8N --> PLANTNET
    N8N --> GEMINI
```

### 6.2 Frontend Architecture

The frontend follows the **Next.js 15 App Router** pattern:

```
frontend/src/
├── app/                    # File-based routing (13 route groups)
│   ├── page.tsx            # Landing page — redirects authenticated users
│   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with AuthProvider
│   ├── globals.css         # Design system — CSS variables (--gg-*)
│   ├── login/              # Email/password login
│   ├── register/           # Role-based registration
│   ├── plants/             # Plant browsing & detail pages
│   │   └── [id]/adopt/     # Adoption application form
│   ├── feed/               # Community social feed
│   ├── map/                # Interactive Leaflet map
│   ├── dashboard/          # Role-based dashboard
│   │   ├── adoptions/      # Adopter's adoption history
│   │   ├── reports/        # Growth report management
│   │   ├── ngo/            # NGO management dashboard
│   │   └── admin/          # Admin platform oversight
│   ├── identify/           # AI plant identification
│   ├── notifications/      # Notification centre
│   └── profile/            # User profiles & settings
├── components/             # Reusable UI components
│   ├── Navbar.tsx          # Role-aware global navigation
│   ├── auth/               # Social login buttons
│   ├── map/                # Map-specific components
│   └── ui/                 # Badge, Skeleton, EmptyState
├── services/
│   └── api.ts              # Centralized Axios API layer (10 domain groups)
├── lib/
│   └── auth.tsx            # AuthContext — global auth state
└── types/
    └── index.ts            # TypeScript interfaces & enums
```

### 6.3 Backend Architecture

```
backend/
├── app.js                  # Express app — middleware chain & route mounting
├── server.js               # Server bootstrap
├── src/
│   ├── config/
│   │   ├── env.js          # Environment variable validation
│   │   └── supabase.js     # Supabase client initialization (anon + admin)
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   ├── auth.middleware.js     # JWT verification + profile loading
│   │   ├── role.middleware.js     # Role-based access control (RBAC)
│   │   ├── rateLimiter.js         # Rate limiting (general / auth / AI)
│   │   ├── validate.js            # Express-validator integration
│   │   ├── errorHandler.js        # Global error handler
│   │   └── upload.js              # Multer file upload config
│   ├── controllers/        # 11 controller modules
│   ├── routes/             # 10 route modules
│   ├── validators/         # Request validation schemas
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── notification.service.js  # In-app notification engine
│   │   └── storage.service.js       # Supabase Storage upload/delete
│   └── utils/
│       ├── response.js     # Standardized JSON response helpers
│       └── pagination.js   # Pagination utility
└── supabase/
    └── migration.sql       # Complete DB schema + RLS policies + PostGIS
```

### 6.4 Request Lifecycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User Browser
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant AX as Axios Instance
    participant BE as Express Backend
    participant MW as Middleware Stack
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: User Action (e.g., Click "Adopt")
    FE->>AX: Call api.adoptionsApi.apply(plantId, answers)
    AX->>AX: Attach Bearer token from localStorage
    AX->>BE: POST /api/adoptions/:plantId/apply
    BE->>MW: auth.middleware → role.middleware → validate
    MW->>BE: req.user = { id, role, email }
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO adoptions (...)
    DB-->>BE: { success: true, data: adoption }
    BE-->>AX: 201 { success: true, data: { ... } }
    AX-->>FE: Response object
    FE->>U: Update UI — "Application Submitted!"
```

