### 7.2 Table Descriptions

| Table | Records | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `profiles` | All users | User identity — role, username, email, bio, avatar, ban status |
| `ngo_profiles` | NGO-specific | Organization details, Darpan ID, mission, admin verification status |
| `plants` | Plant listings | Name, species, PostGIS location, adoption status, images, care info |
| `adoptions` | Applications | Links adopter ↔ plant ↔ NGO with questionnaire answers and review |
| `growth_reports` | Health logs | Periodic plant health reports with height, notes, and photos |
| `posts` | Feed items | Community posts with images, like/bookmark counts |
| `likes` | Interactions | Compound PK (user_id, post_id) — toggle-based |
| `bookmarks` | Saved posts | Compound PK (user_id, post_id) — toggle-based |
| `follows` | Social graph | follower_id → following_id with self-reference check |
| `notifications` | Alerts | Type-based notifications with read status and metadata |

### 7.3 PostGIS Spatial Features

The `plants` table includes a `GEOGRAPHY(Point, 4326)` column indexed with a **GiST spatial index** to support:

- **`ST_DWithin()`** — Find all plants within a given radius (meters) of a coordinate.
- **`ST_Distance()`** — Calculate distance between user and plant for sorting.
- **`nearby_plants()` RPC** — A PostgreSQL function that combines distance calculation, filtering, and coordinate extraction in a single efficient query.

### 7.4 Row-Level Security (RLS) Policies

RLS is enabled on **all 10 tables**, ensuring data isolation at the database level:

| Table | SELECT | INSERT | UPDATE | DELETE |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `profiles` | All users | Own record | Own record | — |
| `ngo_profiles` | All users | Own record | Own record | — |
| `plants` | All users | NGO owner | NGO owner | NGO owner |
| `adoptions` | Involved parties | Adopter | NGO | — |
| `growth_reports` | All users | Adopter | — | — |
| `posts` | All users | Author | — | Author |
| `likes` | Own records | Own records | — | Own records |
| `bookmarks` | Own records | Own records | — | Own records |
| `follows` | All users | Follower | — | Follower |
| `notifications` | Own records | — | Own records | — |

