## Chapter 8 — Module Description

### 8.1 Authentication & Authorization Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Secure user registration, login, logout, and password management |
| **Backend** | `auth.controller.js` + `auth.routes.js` (7 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `login/page.tsx`, `register/page.tsx`, `lib/auth.tsx` (AuthContext) |
| **Technology** | Supabase Auth (email/password), JWT tokens, Bearer header |
| **Key Feature** | Token stored in `localStorage` as `gg_token`; auto-attached by Axios interceptor |

**Flow:**
1. User registers with email, password, username, display_name, and role.
2. Supabase creates an `auth.users` entry + a `profiles` row (via controller upsert).
3. JWT token returned → stored in browser → used for all API calls.
4. `AuthContext` wraps the entire app, providing `useAuth()` hook globally.

### 8.2 NGO Onboarding & Verification Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Multi-step NGO registration with government ID and admin approval |
| **Backend** | `ngo.controller.js` + `admin.controller.js` |
| **Frontend** | `ngo/onboarding/page.tsx`, `dashboard/admin/approvals/page.tsx` |
| **Key Feature** | Darpan ID validation, Impact Questionnaire, admin dossier review |

**Workflow:**
1. User registers as "NGO" role.
2. Redirected to onboarding form: Org Name, Website, Darpan ID, Mission Statement, Questionnaire.
3. Submission creates a `ngo_profiles` record with `status: 'pending'`.
4. Admin views pending NGOs in verification dashboard.
5. Admin reviews dossier and approves/rejects.
6. NGO notified via in-app notification; gains access to plant management on approval.

### 8.3 Plant Management Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | CRUD operations for plant listings with geospatial coordinates |
| **Backend** | `plant.controller.js` (7 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `plants/page.tsx`, `plants/[id]/page.tsx`, `dashboard/ngo/plants/new/page.tsx` |
| **Key Feature** | PostGIS location storage, image upload to Supabase Storage |

**Capabilities:**
- **Create**: NGO fills form with name, species, description, coordinates, and images.
- **Browse**: Paginated plant listing with status filters (available, pending, adopted).
- **Detail View**: Full plant info with gallery, location, NGO details, and "Adopt" button.
- **Nearby Search**: `GET /api/plants/nearby?lat=&lng=&radius=` — PostGIS radius query.
- **Map Data**: `GET /api/plants/map` — returns all plants with coordinates for map markers.

### 8.4 Adoption Workflow Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | End-to-end adoption application lifecycle |
| **Backend** | `adoption.controller.js` (5 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `plants/[id]/adopt/page.tsx`, `dashboard/adoptions/page.tsx` |
| **Key Feature** | Questionnaire-based application, NGO review pipeline |

**Adoption Status Machine:**
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available : Plant listed by NGO
    Available --> Pending : Adopter applies
    Pending --> Approved : NGO approves
    Pending --> Rejected : NGO rejects
    Approved --> [*] : Plant adopted
    Rejected --> Available : Plant re-listed
```

### 8.5 Growth Tracking Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Structured post-adoption plant health monitoring |
| **Backend** | `report.controller.js` (3 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `dashboard/reports/page.tsx`, `dashboard/reports/new/page.tsx` |
| **Health Levels** | `healthy`, `needs_attention`, `critical`, `dead` |
| **Data Captured** | Health status, height (cm), notes, photographs |

### 8.6 Community Social Feed Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Instagram-style social feed for environmental community building |
| **Backend** | `post.controller.js` + `comment.controller.js` (8 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `feed/page.tsx`, `feed/[id]/page.tsx`, `feed/new/page.tsx` |
| **Key Feature** | Infinite scroll via `IntersectionObserver`, follow-weighted feed |

**Social Features:**
- **Posts**: Text + multiple images, optionally linked to a plant.
- **Likes**: Toggle-based (`POST /api/posts/:id/like`), server-side counter sync.
- **Bookmarks**: Toggle-based, viewable in `/dashboard/bookmarks`.
- **Comments**: Threaded comments on posts.
- **Feed Algorithm**: Posts from followed users appear first.

### 8.7 Interactive Map Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Geographic plant discovery and plantation impact visualization |
| **Frontend** | `map/page.tsx`, `components/map/` |
| **Technology** | Leaflet.js + React-Leaflet |
| **Key Feature** | Color-coded markers: 🟢 Available, 🟡 Pending, 🔵 Adopted |

### 8.8 AI Plant Identification Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Image-based plant species recognition and health analysis |
| **Backend** | `ai.controller.js` (2 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `identify/page.tsx` |
| **Pipeline** | Image → n8n Webhook → PlantNet (species) + Gemini (health analysis) |

### 8.9 Admin Dashboard Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Platform oversight, user management, and NGO verification |
| **Backend** | `admin.controller.js` (7 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `dashboard/admin/page.tsx`, `dashboard/admin/users/page.tsx` |
| **Key Feature** | Platform-wide statistics, user ban/unban, NGO approve/reject |

**Admin Statistics:** Total Users, Total Plants, Total Adoptions, Total Posts, Total Reports.

### 8.10 Notification System Module

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Real-time in-app notifications for all user actions |
| **Backend** | `notification.controller.js` + `notification.service.js` (4 endpoints) |
| **Frontend** | `notifications/page.tsx`, Navbar badge counter |
| **Triggers** | Adoption status change, new follower, post like, NGO approval |

