## Chapter 10 — Testing & Validation

### 10.1 Testing Strategy

The project employs a **three-layer testing approach**:

```mermaid
graph TB
    E2E["🧑‍💻 End-to-End Testing\n(Manual QA per role)"]
    INT["🔗 Integration Testing\n(Postman API Collections)"]
    UNIT["⚙️ Unit Testing\n(Jest + Supertest)"]

    E2E --> INT --> UNIT
```

### 10.2 Critical User Journey (CUJ) Test Cases

#### Adopter Journey
| # | Test Case | Steps | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Registration | Fill form, select "Adopter" role, submit | Redirect to dashboard, empty adoptions | ✅ |
| 2 | Plant Discovery | Navigate to `/plants`, browse listings | 3+ plants visible with status badges | ✅ |
| 3 | Adoption Application | Open plant → Click "Adopt" → Submit form | Application in "My Adoptions" with "Pending" badge | ✅ |
| 4 | Map Interaction | Open `/map`, click a pin | Popup with plant name, status, and photo | ✅ |
| 5 | Community Feed | Navigate to `/feed`, like a post | Like count increments, persists on refresh | ✅ |

#### NGO Journey
| # | Test Case | Steps | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Onboarding | Register as NGO → Complete form with Darpan ID | Redirected to "Under Review" status page | ✅ |
| 2 | Plant Listing | Create plant with images + coordinates | Plant appears in gallery and on map | ✅ |
| 3 | Application Review | View adoption applications → Approve one | Adopter status changes to "Approved" | ✅ |

#### Admin Journey
| # | Test Case | Steps | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | NGO Verification | View pending NGOs → Review dossier → Approve | NGO gains plant management access | ✅ |
| 2 | User Management | View users → Ban a user | User blocked from API access | ✅ |
| 3 | Platform Stats | View admin dashboard | Accurate counts for users, plants, adoptions | ✅ |

### 10.3 Edge Case Testing

| Feature | Edge Case | Expected Behavior | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| Auth | Incorrect password login | Error: "Invalid email or password" | ✅ |
| Registration | Duplicate username | Error: "Username is already taken" | ✅ |
| Adoption | Adopt already-pending plant | Button disabled or form hidden | ✅ |
| File Upload | Upload .exe file | Validation error: "Image files only" | ✅ |
| AI Identifier | Non-plant image | Graceful: "No plant identified" | ✅ |
| Feed | Empty content post | Form validation blocks submission | ✅ |
| RLS | Update another user's plant | API returns 403 Forbidden | ✅ |

### 10.4 API Testing (Postman)

A complete **Postman collection** was created to test all 40+ endpoints:

| Category | Endpoints Tested | Auth Required |
|---|---|---|
| Authentication | 7 | Mixed |
| Plants | 7 | Yes |
| Adoptions | 5 | Yes |
| Posts & Feed | 8 | Yes |
| Profiles | 7 | Yes |
| Reports | 3 | Yes |
| Notifications | 4 | Yes |
| Admin | 7 | Yes (admin) |
| NGO | 4 | Yes (ngo) |
| AI | 2 | Yes |

